    "title": "Bloons Card Storm",
    "description": "The Storm gathers, and only true Heroes can stem the Bloon tide. Gather up your cards, choose your favorite Hero, and enter the Arena to claim victory!\r\n\r\nFrom the makers of Bloons TD 6 comes a revolutionary collectible card game featuring the fan-favorite Monkeys and Bloons, rendered and animated in gorgeous 3D. Develop deep strategies, build your collection by crafting awesome cards, and carefully construct decks to help you win PvP and single player games.\r\n\r\nFeaturing 4 unique Heroes with 3 Hero Abilities each, 130+ cards at launch, and 5 different Arenas to battle on, the tactical combinations are endless!\r\n\r\nBALANCE OFFENSE AND DEFENSE\r\n\r\nMonkeys can't attack other Monkeys, so you'll need to stock up on both Bloon AND Monkey cards in order to win. Send Bloons swarming at your opponent, fend off opposing Bloon rushes with your Monkeys, and find that perfect balance essential for victory!\r\n\r\nUSE HERO ABILITIES WISELY\r\n\r\nPlaying Bloons will power up Hero Abilities that can turn the tide of battle in your favor. Whether it is Quincy with his bow or Gwen with her flamethrower, each Hero has a unique set of potent Hero Abilities. Choose them wisely!\r\n\r\nTEST YOURSELF IN SOLO ADVENTURES\r\n\r\nLooking for something more relaxing than fur-flying PvP action? Our solo Adventures are crafted single-player experiences that will test your deck building and game management skills to the limit. Try out the Prologue Adventures or support the game by buying the full DLC Adventures.\r\n\r\nFULLY CROSS-PLATFORM\r\n\r\nTake your collection of Bloons and Monkeys with you wherever you go, as Bloons Card Storm is fully cross-platform - just register your account and your progress stays with you.\r\n\r\nBUILD THE BEST DECKS\r\n\r\nBuild crazy combo behemoths, fun theme decks, or use the latest meta decklists - the choice is yours!\r\n\r\nPLAY AGAINST YOUR FRIENDS\r\n\r\nPrivate match support at launch so you can challenge your friends to a game anywhere, anytime! Matchmaking is also fully cross-platform so what are you waiting for?\r\n\r\nDownload now and join the Card Storm!",
